; Wire-order fabrication policy for live sessions.
;
; A tools/list declaration can cross the wire just after a call it authorises.
; GRACE gives that declaration 500ms to arrive. A call still undeclared at the
; deadline is CONDEMNED; a declaration within the window resolves it. The
; liveness rule is additive, so a declared tool must still be called once.

on tool_declared as $tool:
    EXPECT tool_called for $tool
    WINDOW 5000

ASSERT no tool_called where identifier not in tool_declared GRACE 500
